    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27631" root="ظلف" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلْفَآءُ</span></b>  <i>A smooth stone</i> or <i>rock,</i> or <i>a hard,
smooth, large stone,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفَاةٌ</span>,) <i>even with the ground,</i>
(T, O, K,) <i>round</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مدورة</span>), (so in a copy of the T,
[i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَوَّرَة</span>,]) or <i>extended</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْدُودَة</span>). (O, K.)

